OL,4,CBaby P's mother given open prison      
OL,5,Crecommendation                         
OL,6,GThe mother of the toddler known as     
OL,7,GBaby P - who died after months of      
OL,8,Gabuse - has been told she will not be  
OL,9,Gfreed from jail, although the Parole   
OL,10,GBoard has recommended she should be    
OL,11,Gmoved to an open prison.               
OL,13,FTracey Connelly, now 45, was jailed in 
OL,14,F2009 for causing or allowing the death 
OL,15,Fof her 17-month-old son Peter at their 
OL,16,Fhome in Tottenham, north London, in    
OL,17,FAugust 2007.                           
OL,19,FConnelly has been freed twice, in      
OL,20,FOctober 2013 and July 2022, and        
OL,21,Frecalled to prison both times, in      
OL,22,FFebruary 2015 and August 2024.         
